 in stato di ubriachezza anni prima e dalla quale aveva divorziato il giorno successivo si rifà viva per comunicargli che lui è il padre dei suoi due gemelli e, visto che lei sarà in carcere per due settimane per una protesta politica, dovrà essere lui ad occuparsene. Ora Dan ha bisogno dell'amico Charlie se vuole potersi occupare dei pargoli e, al contempo, chiudere il contratto."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Charlie and Dan have been best friends and business partners for thirty years; their Manhattan public relations firm is on the verge of a huge business deal with a Japanese company. With two weeks to sew up the contract, Dan gets a surprise: a woman he married on a drunken impulse nearly nine years before (annulled the next day) shows up to tell him he's the father of her twins, now seven, and she'll be in jail for 14 days for a political protest. Dan volunteers to keep the tykes, although he's uptight and clueless. With Charlie's help is there any way they can be dad and uncle, meet the kids' expectations, and still land the account?","tagline":"Sit. Stay. Play Dad."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xdpJr7jux0AOoqlAlZFX6nznVFd.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q11l98jbETEsPHp5PYf34mcA30o.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":22949,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xdpJr7jux0AOoqlAlZFX6nznVFd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xdpJr7jux0AOoqlAlZFX6nznVFd.jpg","language":"it","width":703,"height":1000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xdpJr7jux0AOoqlAlZFX6nznVFd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xdpJr7jux0AOoqlAlZFX6nznVFd.jpg","language":"it","width":703,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/